  "prefLabel": "Cor 412.01 Permission for Release of Information",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Cor 412.01 Permission for Release of Information. Residents shall complete and sign a “Release of Information Form” (revised 5/2019) as referenced in Cor 412.03 prior to the release of information from their non-medical client records. A copy of the completed form shall be maintained in the client record. The release shall expire 6 months from the date of issue.\n\nSource. #13082, eff 8-6-20",
